#: includes/class-abilities.php:480
msgctxt "ability description"
msgid "Deletes old revisions now under the current retention policy, one batch of posts, carrying on from where the current sweep got to; the schedule then works through the rest a minute at a time. Deleted revisions cannot be brought back. Returns how many revisions were removed and whether the sweep reached the end. On a network that keeps the revision policy to itself, only a network administrator may run it. Never returns posts or their titles."
